{"v":1,"path":"/Components/SDKManager/DJISDKManager.html","title":"DJI Mobile SDK Documentation","mainClass":"site-main","tocClass":"site-toc","mainHtml":"\n        <div id=\"ifm-overview\" class=\"article ifm-page\" data-prerender=\"overview members methods\"><div class=\"article\" style=\"display: none;\"><h1><font color=\"#AAA\">class </font>ISDKManager</h1></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"title class_\">ISDKManager</span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<nav class=\"ifm-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><span>Common APIs</span><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><span aria-current=\"page\">ISDKManager</span></nav><div class=\"ifm-eyebrow\" id=\"ifm-overview\"><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-kind-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div><h1 class=\"ifm-title\">ISDKManager</h1><p class=\"ifm-lead\">Class that is used for SDK management.</p><div class=\"ifm-meta-line\"><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7.5 12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5z\"></path><path d=\"m4 7.5 8 4.5 8-4.5M12 12v9\"></path></svg>Package <code>dji.v5.manager.interfaces</code><button class=\"ifm-mini-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"dji.v5.manager.interfaces\" aria-label=\"Copy package name\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path></svg></button></span><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"></path></svg>Android · Java / Kotlin</span></div><h5 id=\"Description\" style=\"display: none;\">Description:</h5>\n<p style=\"display: none;\"><font color=\"#666\">Class that is used for SDK management. It is used to initialize and register to SDK, connect to product, get product information. Also it can get the other manager classes and debug tools. <br><br><code><i>Supported since MSDK 5.0.0</i></code></font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"ifm-members-section\" id=\"ifm-members-nav\"><div class=\"ifm-section-head\"><h2>Members</h2><span class=\"ifm-section-note\"><span class=\"ifm-count\">15</span> members</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-tools\"><div class=\"ifm-member-search\"><svg class=\"ifm-search-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-3.4-3.4\"></path></svg><input type=\"search\" id=\"ifm-search\" placeholder=\"Filter by name, parameter or description\" aria-label=\"Filter members\"><button class=\"ifm-search-clear\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Clear search\" hidden=\"\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"ifm-filter-group\"><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"method\">Method</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"enum\">Enum</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"class\">Class</button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-groups\" id=\"ifm-groups\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"method\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>Method</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">7</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"isdkmanager_init2_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"init msdk is initialized, and the msdk internal module initialization operation is performed.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">init</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">MSDK is initialized, and the MSDK internal module initialization operation is performed.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"isdkmanager_init_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"init deprecated, it is recommended to use the new init in version 5.20.0.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">init</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Deprecated, it is recommended to use the new init in version 5.20.0.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"isdkmanager_isregistered_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"isregistered get msdk registration status.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">isRegistered</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Get MSDK registration status.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"isdkmanager_destroy_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"destroy release msdk’s occupation of resources.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">destroy</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Release MSDK’s occupation of resources.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"isdkmanager_registerapp_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"registerapp msdk registration, msdk connects to the dji server through the internet to verify the app key applied by the developer on the official website.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">registerApp</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">MSDK registration, MSDK connects to the DJI server through the Internet to verify the App KEY applied by the developer on the official website.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"isdkmanager_getsdkversion_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getsdkversion get the msdk version number.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getSDKVersion</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Get the MSDK version number.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"isdkmanager_getproductcategory_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getproductcategory get the msdk package type.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getProductCategory</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Get the MSDK package type.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"enum\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>Enum</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">3</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"isdkmanager_packageproductcategory_inline\" data-category=\"enum\" data-search=\"packageproductcategory msdk package type.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">enum</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">PackageProductCategory</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">MSDK package type.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"isdkmanager_sdklinkmode_inline\" data-category=\"enum\" data-search=\"sdklinkmode msdk link mode.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">enum</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">SDKLinKMode</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">MSDK link mode.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"isdkmanager_serverstate_inline\" data-category=\"enum\" data-search=\"serverstate connection state with the remote service.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">enum</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">ServerState</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Connection state with the remote service.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"class\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>Class</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">5</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"sdkmanagercallback sdkmanager callback class.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">SDKManagerCallback</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">SDKManager callback class.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"isdkmanager_initsettings_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"initsettings msdk initialization settings.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">InitSettings</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">MSDK initialization settings.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"isdkmanager_pluginappconfig_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"pluginappconfig plugin app information configuration.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">PluginAPPConfig</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Plugin APP information configuration.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"isdkmanager_appversion_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"appversion app version information.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">APPVersion</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">APP version information.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"isdkmanager_openlocation_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"openlocation open geographic location information, containing latitude, longitude and altitude data.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">OpenLocation</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Open geographic location information, containing latitude, longitude and altitude data.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">No matching members. Try a shorter keyword.</div></div>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"isdkmanager_init2\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#isdkmanager_init2_inline\">init</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"isdkmanager_init2_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>init</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">init</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">Context</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">context</span>, <span class=\"jv-type\">InitSettings</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">settings</span>, <span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><span class=\"jv-type\">SDKManagerCallback</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">callback</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">MSDK is initialized, and the MSDK internal module initialization operation is performed. After the initialization is completed, <code><a href=\"DJISDKManager.html#isdkmanager_registerapp\">registerApp</a></code> needs to be called to perform the MSDK registration operation. <br></font></p><div class=\"ifm-callout\"><font color=\"#666\"><strong>Note</strong><br><br> MSDK will always hold a strong reference to the <code><a href=\"ISDKManager_SDKManagerCallback.html#isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback\">SDKManagerCallback</a></code> object, please do not let <code><a href=\"ISDKManager_SDKManagerCallback.html#isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback\">SDKManagerCallback</a></code> to hold objects with a short life cycle in the program, such as Activity and Fragment, otherwise there will be memory leaks.</font></div><p></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>context</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Context</span> </code></span></td><td>Context instance applied.</td></tr><tr><td><code>settings</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"ISDKManager_InitSettings.html#isdkmanager_initsettings\"><span class=\"jv-type\">InitSettings</span></a> </code></span></td><td>Initial configuration.</td></tr><tr><td><code>callback</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><a href=\"ISDKManager_SDKManagerCallback.html#isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback\"><span class=\"jv-type\">SDKManagerCallback</span></a> </code></span></td><td>return callback of the execution result.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row api-deprecated\" id=\"isdkmanager_init\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#isdkmanager_init_inline\">init</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc api-deprecated\" id=\"isdkmanager_init_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>init</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-deprecated-badge\">Deprecated</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@Deprecated</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><wbr><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">init</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">Context</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">context</span>, <span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><span class=\"jv-type\">SDKManagerCallback</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">callback</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\"><span class=\"deprecated-reason\">Deprecated, it is recommended to use the new <code><code><a href=\"DJISDKManager.html#isdkmanager_init2\">init</a></code></code> in version 5.20.0. </span> MSDK is initialized, and the MSDK internal module initialization operation is performed. After the initialization is completed, <code><a href=\"DJISDKManager.html#isdkmanager_registerapp\">registerApp</a></code> needs to be called to perform the MSDK registration operation. <br></font></p><div class=\"ifm-callout\"><font color=\"#666\"><strong>Note</strong><br><br> MSDK will always hold a strong reference to the <code><a href=\"ISDKManager_SDKManagerCallback.html#isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback\">SDKManagerCallback</a></code> object, please do not let <code><a href=\"ISDKManager_SDKManagerCallback.html#isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback\">SDKManagerCallback</a></code> to hold objects with a short life cycle in the program, such as Activity and Fragment, otherwise there will be memory leaks.</font></div><p></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>context</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Context</span> </code></span></td><td>Context instance applied.</td></tr><tr><td><code>callback</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><a href=\"ISDKManager_SDKManagerCallback.html#isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback\"><span class=\"jv-type\">SDKManagerCallback</span></a> </code></span></td><td>return callback of the execution result.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"isdkmanager_isregistered\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#isdkmanager_isregistered_inline\">isRegistered</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"isdkmanager_isregistered_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>isRegistered</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">isRegistered</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Get MSDK registration status. <code>true</code> means that the MSDK has been registered successfully.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">boolean</font></code></td><td>true means that the MSDK has been registered successfully.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"isdkmanager_destroy\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#isdkmanager_destroy_inline\">destroy</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"isdkmanager_destroy_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>destroy</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">destroy</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Release MSDK’s occupation of resources. After release, all callback interfaces will no longer receive any event updates from the system. Note: <code>init</code> and <code>destroy</code> should appear in pairs in the App.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n</font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"isdkmanager_registerapp\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#isdkmanager_registerapp_inline\">registerApp</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"isdkmanager_registerapp_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>registerApp</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">registerApp</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">MSDK registration, MSDK connects to the DJI server through the Internet to verify the App KEY applied by the developer on the official website. This method needs to be called after the <code><a href=\"ISDKManager_SDKManagerCallback.html#isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback_djisdkinitevent_initialize_complete\">INITIALIZE_COMPLETE</a></code> event is returned in the <code><a href=\"ISDKManager_SDKManagerCallback.html#isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback_oninitprocess\">onInitProcess</a></code> method. Whether the registration is successful or the registration fails, it will be returned in <code><a href=\"ISDKManager_SDKManagerCallback.html#isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback\">SDKManagerCallback</a></code>. After successful registration, MSDK will automatically start to connect to the hardware product. If the hardware product connection is successful, the <code><a href=\"ISDKManager_SDKManagerCallback.html#isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback_onproductconnect\">onProductConnect</a></code> method will be called back. <br></font></p><div class=\"ifm-callout\"><font color=\"#666\"><strong>Note</strong><br><br>1. If the developer uses the offline license file method to open LDM before <code><a href=\"DJISDKManager.html#isdkmanager_registerapp\">registerApp</a></code>, the registration operation can be completed without connecting to the Internet. <br>2. If you use the method of downloading the license file from the Internet to enable LDM, you need to pass in <code><a href=\"../ILDMManager/ILDMManager.html#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule_msdk_init_and_registration\">MSDK_INIT_AND_REGISTRATION</a></code> to <code><a href=\"../ILDMManager/ILDMManager.html#ildmmanager_enableldm\">enableLDM</a></code>, in order to connect to the DJI server through the Internet to verify the App KEY and complete the registration process. <br>3. After MSDK is successfully registered, the registration information will be cached locally. When MSDK is started again, MSDK will verify the locally cached information to complete the registration process without connecting to the Internet. It is not necessary to perform online registration again until the application is reinstalled to complete the registration process.</font></div><p></p><font color=\"#666\">\n</font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"isdkmanager_getsdkversion\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#isdkmanager_getsdkversion_inline\">getSDKVersion</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"isdkmanager_getsdkversion_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getSDKVersion</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getSDKVersion</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Get the MSDK version number.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">String</font></code></td><td>Return the MSDK version number.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"isdkmanager_getproductcategory\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#isdkmanager_getproductcategory_inline\">getProductCategory</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"isdkmanager_getproductcategory_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getProductCategory</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">PackageProductCategory</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getProductCategory</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Get the MSDK package type.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"DJISDKManager.html#isdkmanager_packageproductcategory\">PackageProductCategory</a></font></code></td><td>Return the MSDK package type.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<h5 id=\"Related\">Related:</h5>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"isdkmanager_packageproductcategory\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">enum</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#isdkmanager_packageproductcategory_inline\">PackageProductCategory</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"isdkmanager_packageproductcategory_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">enum</span><h3>PackageProductCategory</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">enum</span> <span class=\"title class_\">PackageProductCategory</span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.common.register</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">MSDK package type.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Enum Members</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#isdkmanager_packageproductcategory_aircraft_inline\"></a>AIRCRAFT</font></code></td><td>Aircraft category, this MSDK package only contains all aircraft supported by MSDK.</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#isdkmanager_packageproductcategory_handheld_inline\"></a>HANDHELD</font></code></td><td>Handheld category, this MSDK package only contains all handhelds supported by MSDK.</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#isdkmanager_packageproductcategory_all_inline\"></a>ALL</font></code></td><td>All categories, this MSDK package contains all DJI products supported by MSDK.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n</font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">class</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a href=\"ISDKManager_SDKManagerCallback.html\">SDKManagerCallback<